{
  "about": "Render test cases. The cloud build runs each command on the test photo (iPad simulator, -renderGallery) and dev-tools/ci_results.py checks the picture against the base case (or the case named in vs). Metrics: mean_luma, p5_luma, p25_luma, p50_luma, p75_luma, p95_luma, mean_sat, mean_r, mean_g, mean_b, diff, peak. Directions: up, down, changed, same.",
  "cases": [
